            <div class="theory-box">
                <h3>📐 As 5 Fórmulas Fundamentais</h3>
                <p>Considere um triângulo retângulo com hipotenusa <strong>a</strong>, catetos <strong>b</strong> e <strong>c</strong>, altura <strong>h</strong>, e projeções <strong>m</strong> (sombra de b) e <strong>n</strong> (sombra de c).</p>

                <svg class="desenho" viewBox="0 0 320 160" role="img" aria-label="Triângulo Retângulo com hipotenusa na base e altura">
                    <polygon class="d-fundo" points="25,125 295,125 105,25"/>
                    <line class="d-linha" style="stroke: var(--theme-contrast);" x1="105" y1="25" x2="105" y2="125"/>
                    <line class="d-linha" x1="25" y1="125" x2="295" y2="125"/>
                    <rect x="95" y="115" width="10" height="10" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="55" y="65">c</text>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="210" y="65">b</text>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="115" y="80" style="fill: var(--theme-contrast);">h</text>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="60" y="145">n</text>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="195" y="145">m</text>
                    <text class="d-texto" x="160" y="156" text-anchor="middle">Hipotenusa a = m + n</text>
                </svg>

                <div class="vmath-box">
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">1. Pitágoras</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">a² = b² + c²</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">2. Cateto b</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">b² = a · m</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">3. Cateto c</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">c² = a · n</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">4. Altura h</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">h² = m · n</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">5. Produto Cruzado</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">a · h = b · c</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloco 3: Trigonometria -->
        <div class="content-group theory-searchable">
            <span class="section-badge">3. Trigonometria no Triângulo Retângulo</span>
            <div class="theory-box">
                <h3>🔢 Razões Trigonométricas Separadas & Tabela</h3>
                
                <div class="vmath-box">
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">Seno (SOH)</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">sen(α) = <span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">Cateto Oposto</span><span class="vden">Hipotenusa</span></span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">Cosseno (CAH)</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">cos(α) = <span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">Cateto Adjacente</span><span class="vden">Hipotenusa</span></span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="vmath-row">
                        <span class="vmath-label">Tangente (CO-CA)</span>
                        <span class="vmath-expr">tg(α) = <span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">Cateto Oposto</span><span class="vden">Cateto Adjacente</span></span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table class="tabela">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Razão</th>
                                <th>30°</th>
                                <th>45°</th>
                                <th>60°</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Seno</strong></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">1</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">√2</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">√3</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Cosseno</strong></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">√3</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">√2</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">1</span><span class="vden">2</span></span></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><strong>Tangente</strong></td>
                                <td><span class="vfrac"><span class="vnum">√3</span><span class="vden">3</span></span></td>
                                <td><strong>1</strong></td>
                                <td><strong>√3</strong></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bloco 4: Circunferência e Círculo -->
        <div class="content-group theory-searchable">
            <span class="section-badge">4. Circunferência e Círculo</span>
            <div class="theory-box">
